{
  "id": "80876",
  "type": "Page",
  "tags": [],
  "title": "Coordination Compounds and Ligands",
  "content": {
    "bibrefs": [],
    "model": [
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "The hemoglobin in your blood, the chlorophyll in green plants, vitamin B"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "12"
              },
              {
                "text": ", and the catalyst used in the manufacture of polyethylene each contains a "
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "coordination compound"
                  }
                ],
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "A stable substance consisting of a central metal atom or ion (acting as a Lewis acid) surrounded by molecules or ions (ligands) that donate pairs of electrons (acting as Lewis bases) through coordinate covalent bonds."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "2115786370",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "3094135451",
                "trigger": "hover",
                "type": "popup"
              },
              {
                "text": ". Ions of the metals, especially the transition metals, are likely to form complexes. Many of these compounds are highly colored (see figure below). In this module, we consider the structure and bonding of these remarkable compounds."
              }
            ],
            "id": "2676563522",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "caption": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "Transition metal complexes are sometimes colorful, and sometimes colorless.  This figure shows, from left to right, solutions containing [Sc(H"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "O)"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "6"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "]"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "3+"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": " ions (colorless), [Cr(H"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "O)"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "6"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "]"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "3+"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": " ions (purple), [Co(H"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "O)"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "6"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "]"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "2+"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": " ions (red), [Ni(H"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "O)"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "6"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "]"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "2+"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": " ions (green), [Cu(H"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "O)"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "6"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "]"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "2+"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": " ions (blue), and [Zn(H"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "O)"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "6"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "]"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "2+"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": " ions (colorless). (Credit: Sahar Atwa.)"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1524003735",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "t905q8ble6hvm4m",
                "text": ""
              }
            ],
            "display": "block",
            "height": 260.5,
            "id": "1874166043",
            "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/32/32DEBE8F0FEFB4635FEA49ED8CA8A07B/metal_ions_colors.png",
